('cba1b468-4afc-40ff-b05b-c03cb82bf129', 73, 'Not by might nor by power, but by my Spirit, says the Lord Almighty.', 'Zechariah 4:6', 'The mountains before me will not fall by human striving or raw muscle, but by the breath and power of the Holy Spirit. God is making a smooth way forward.', 'holy_spirit', 'hombres'),
('342ec618-cd7c-4faa-ad47-fbd3d0e72598', 74, 'Praise the Lord, my soul, and forget not all his benefits—who forgives all your sins and heals all your diseases.', 'Psalm 103:2-3', 'Standing on the Word: God restores my physical vitality and mends my internal battles. I walk in divine health and renewed vigor to complete my assignment.', 'sanidad', 'hombres'),
