('eedcf378-fd35-4785-b798-a68a02374f18', 78, 'But you will receive power when the Holy Spirit comes on you; and you will be my witnesses in Jerusalem, and in all Judea and Samaria, and to the ends of the earth.', 'Acts 1:8', 'I am baptized with supernatural power. The Holy Spirit empowers me to be a bold, unashamed witness for Jesus in my home, my city, and every sphere of influence.', 'holy_spirit', 'hombres'),
