('7324a2c7-c1f1-40cd-8759-0fe09832f110', 87, 'Whatever you do, work at it with all your heart, as working for the Lord, not for human masters.', 'Colossians 3:23', 'As a man of God, I speak life: I execute my work with excellence, honor, and tireless diligence. I report directly to King Jesus, and His favor crowns my labor.', 'negocios', 'hombres'),
('2ddb77e4-badf-4593-aad2-75a8f6936200', 88, 'For those who are led by the Spirit of God are the children of God.', 'Romans 8:14', 'I am a true son of the living God, led daily by His Holy Spirit. My flesh does not dictate my direction; the Spirit guides my impulses, decisions, and heart.', 'holy_spirit', 'hombres'),
('9f5be3aa-73fa-4cd4-a256-b660898698c9', 89, 'Be alert and of sober mind. Your enemy the devil prowls around like a roaring lion looking for someone to devour. Resist him, standing firm in the faith.', '1 Peter 5:8-9', 'As a man of God, I speak life: I stay spiritually vigilant and sober-minded. When the enemy roars, I roar back with the truth of God\'s Word and stand victorious.', 'valentia', 'hombres'),
