('78df2acb-d979-4b17-bbe1-8ac93cc1689a', 158, 'But when he, the Spirit of truth, comes, he will guide you into all the truth. He will not speak on his own; he will speak only what he hears, and he will tell you what is yet to come.', 'John 16:13', 'The Spirit of Truth guides my every step. I do not walk in confusion or second-guessing; the Holy Spirit illuminates my path and reveals God’s wisdom to my spirit.', 'holy_spirit', 'hombres'),
('ba438441-beb7-4e37-a73d-b126f966e1ad', 159, 'It is God who arms me with strength and keeps my way secure.', 'Psalm 18:32', 'Today I declare with authority: God equips my spirit with supernatural stamina. He clears my path of traps and keeps my footing firm on the heights.', 'fortaleza', 'hombres'),
('dbfe07d8-c9b1-4e46-ada7-fd4ed8fc5c9e', 160, 'Trust in the Lord with all your heart and lean not on your own understanding; in all your ways submit to him, and he will make your paths straight.', 'Proverbs 3:5-6', 'Today I declare with authority: I surrender my human logic to God\'s higher wisdom. In every business venture and life decision, He aligns my steps and straightens my path.', 'proposito', 'hombres'),
('574e6b4d-c71a-4eec-800a-7baf1003239f', 161, 'He has shown you, O mortal, what is good. And what does the Lord require of you? To act justly and to love mercy and to walk humbly with your God.', 'Micah 6:8', 'Today I declare with authority: True manhood is found in humble obedience. I practice justice, extend mercy, and walk in reverent fellowship with my Creator.', 'identidad', 'hombres'),
('d238d16e-48bd-4641-9cd9-0ed0b0522e49', 162, 'Whatever you do, work at it with all your heart, as working for the Lord, not for human masters.', 'Colossians 3:23', 'Today I declare with authority: I execute my work with excellence, honor, and tireless diligence. I report directly to King Jesus, and His favor crowns my labor.', 'negocios', 'hombres'),
('af162acd-7f90-4773-8fc2-d9f5001b81ff', 163, 'For those who are led by the Spirit of God are the children of God.', 'Romans 8:14', 'I am a true son of the living God, led daily by His Holy Spirit. My flesh does not dictate my direction; the Spirit guides my impulses, decisions, and heart.', 'holy_spirit', 'hombres'),
('303017aa-baea-4f45-b946-0314d43e48dc', 164, 'Be alert and of sober mind. Your enemy the devil prowls around like a roaring lion looking for someone to devour. Resist him, standing firm in the faith.', '1 Peter 5:8-9', 'Today I declare with authority: I stay spiritually vigilant and sober-minded. When the enemy roars, I roar back with the truth of God\'s Word and stand victorious.', 'valentia', 'hombres'),
('ed1418d7-89ae-4f94-8c08-f43ff819da6d', 165, 'But as for me and my household, we will serve the Lord.', 'Joshua 24:15', 'Today I declare with authority: As the spiritual patriarch of my home, I make a holy decree: my house belongs to Jesus. We will honor, worship, and serve Him forever.', 'familia', 'hombres'),
('f8cd25b3-d49e-4ce8-aaf4-b0304e48fbe9', 166, 'The weapons we fight with are not the weapons of the world. On the contrary, they have divine power to demolish strongholds.', '2 Corinthians 10:4', 'Today I declare with authority: I wield heavenly firepower through prayer, the Word, and faith. Mental strongholds, generational addictions, and fears are demolished.', 'batallas', 'hombres'),
('9f240354-25f2-446f-80cf-94d2a6a2ae66', 167, 'Don’t be afraid of them. Remember the Lord, who is great and awesome, and fight for your families, your sons and your daughters, your wives and your homes.', 'Nehemiah 4:14', 'Today I declare with authority: I will never back down when defending what God gave me. I fight in faith for my family, my marriage, and my legacy.', 'liderazgo', 'hombres'),
('12a36cde-48ae-47c8-a541-42f6d56119b6', 168, 'In the same way, the Spirit helps us in our weakness. We do not know what we ought to pray for, but the Spirit himself intercedes for us through wordless groans.', 'Romans 8:26', 'When I am weak or do not know what to pray, the Holy Spirit carries my petitions. His divine intercession aligns my prayers perfectly with the will of the Father.', 'holy_spirit', 'hombres'),
('ccb3fe22-c722-4299-b542-5e719969a26c', 169, 'Let us throw off everything that hinders and the sin that so easily entangles. And let us run with perseverance the race marked out for us, fixing our eyes on Jesus.', 'Hebrews 12:1-2', 'Today I declare with authority: I cast away every weight and distraction. With my eyes locked onto Christ, I run my race with relentless grit and endurance.', 'fortaleza', 'hombres'),
('c40185a7-a433-4683-8f19-e624052a2163', 170, 'But remember the Lord your God, for it is he who gives you the ability to produce wealth.', 'Deuteronomy 8:18', 'Today I declare with authority: God is the author of my capacity to create value and wealth. I manage His resources with wisdom, generosity, and Kingdom purpose.', 'provision', 'hombres'),
('a183fd29-6c69-47ea-9d1a-ad7a3cd2263e', 171, 'Yet he did not waver through unbelief regarding the promise of God, but was strengthened in his faith and gave glory to God, being fully persuaded.', 'Romans 4:20-21', 'Today I declare with authority: Like Abraham, I refuse to waver in doubt. God\'s promise is certain, and my faith gives Him immense glory as I wait on His fulfillment.', 'fe', 'hombres'),
('3e113ab2-4b00-4c53-a0b7-c1981d67ceb8', 172, 'Though an army besiege me, my heart will not fear; though war break out against me, even then I will be confident.', 'Psalm 27:3', 'Today I declare with authority: Surrounded by pressures and deadlines, my inner man remains at rest. The Peace of God rules like a sentinel in my soul.', 'paz', 'hombres'),
('0fcd26b2-aa5c-4572-a406-6e22e8898c97', 173, 'But the fruit of the Spirit is love, joy, peace, forbearance, kindness, goodness, faithfulness, gentleness and self-control. Against such things there is no law.', 'Galatians 5:22-23', 'The character of Jesus flourishes within me. By the Holy Spirit, I walk in supernatural love, unshakeable joy, and masculine self-control in every pressure.', 'holy_spirit', 'hombres'),
('1b788f00-1d3b-4943-b24a-38792843ecfe', 174, 'Praise the Lord, my soul, and forget not all his benefits—who forgives all your sins and heals all your diseases.', 'Psalm 103:2-3', 'Today I declare with authority: God restores my physical vitality and mends my internal battles. I walk in divine health and renewed vigor to complete my assignment.', 'sanidad', 'hombres'),
('f07fd024-100c-47b0-8878-7c990a784ad6', 175, 'Enter his gates with thanksgiving and his courts with praise; give thanks to him and praise his name.', 'Psalm 100:4', 'Today I declare with authority: I start my day by lifting up the Name of Jesus. A warrior\'s greatest weapon is a thankful spirit that praises God in advance of victory.', 'gratitud', 'hombres'),
('4c82ee47-c323-4e6f-a2b6-0b9390c7e9d4', 176, 'Have I not commanded you? Be strong and courageous. Do not be afraid; do not be discouraged, for the Lord your God will be with you wherever you go.', 'Joshua 1:9', 'Standing on the Word: Fear has no dominion over my decisions. I step into every battle with warrior courage because the Lord of Hosts marches with me.', 'valentia', 'hombres'),
('c033314e-8d71-4d03-8bc5-2d037940a8e0', 177, 'Be on your guard; stand firm in the faith; be courageous; be strong. Do everything in love.', '1 Corinthians 16:13', 'Standing on the Word: I stand guard over my convictions and my family. I am rooted in unshakeable faith and divine strength, acting with courageous love.', 'fortaleza', 'hombres'),
('234a771d-9f74-4afe-b4b2-8ed7c31ef6e8', 178, 'Do you not know that your bodies are temples of the Holy Spirit, who is in you, whom you have received from God? You are not your own; you were bought at a price.', '1 Corinthians 6:19-20', 'My body is a holy sanctuary of the Spirit of God. I honor God with my eyes, my thoughts, and my physical strength, refusing every snare of impurity.', 'holy_spirit', 'hombres'),
('f2e9fd92-6d54-4fbf-823a-1cde8f5716eb', 179, 'As iron sharpens iron, so one person sharpens another.', 'Proverbs 27:17', 'Standing on the Word: I surround myself with godly brothers and speak wisdom into those I lead. We sharpen one another for Kingdom greatness.', 'liderazgo', 'hombres'),
('a6798964-c6d9-4b3d-a107-184b808a612e', 180, 'Praise be to the Lord my Rock, who trains my hands for war, my fingers for battle.', 'Psalm 144:1', 'Standing on the Word: The Lord is my Rock and trainer in spiritual warfare. Through prayer and scripture, every enemy scheme formed against my house is broken.', 'batallas', 'hombres'),
('94205adb-c607-4df3-b993-34dbf9096e93', 181, 'Finally, be strong in the Lord and in his mighty power. Put on the full armor of God, so that you can take your stand against the devil’s schemes.', 'Ephesians 6:10-11', 'Standing on the Word: I strap on the full armor of God daily. I do not fight in my own flesh, but stand immovable in the almighty power of Jesus Christ.', 'batallas', 'hombres'),
('f4ad320e-2394-4590-9b93-fc9e31b08027', 182, 'Join with me in suffering, like a good soldier of Christ Jesus.', '2 Timothy 2:3', 'Standing on the Word: I embrace discipline and sacrifice. Like a focused soldier, I refuse civilian distractions and run my race to please my King.', 'disciplina', 'hombres'),
('d3ead0e3-f9b5-4a3f-a42d-8f3148b8eab0', 183, 'For the Spirit God gave us does not make us timid, but gives us power, love and self-discipline.', '2 Timothy 1:7', 'Timidity and cowardice have no room in my soul. The Holy Spirit fuels me with holy courage, boundless agape love, and laser-sharp self-mastery.', 'holy_spirit', 'hombres'),
('fcc0ce1f-7112-4ca2-9d0b-9d4799e02709', 184, 'It is God who arms me with strength and keeps my way secure.', 'Psalm 18:32', 'Standing on the Word: God equips my spirit with supernatural stamina. He clears my path of traps and keeps my footing firm on the heights.', 'fortaleza', 'hombres'),
('0e321225-f3cc-445d-a8bb-b632030928f7', 185, 'Trust in the Lord with all your heart and lean not on your own understanding; in all your ways submit to him, and he will make your paths straight.', 'Proverbs 3:5-6', 'Standing on the Word: I surrender my human logic to God\'s higher wisdom. In every business venture and life decision, He aligns my steps and straightens my path.', 'proposito', 'hombres'),
('4915ac33-4f5b-450d-a267-29ecf69704bd', 186, 'He has shown you, O mortal, what is good. And what does the Lord require of you? To act justly and to love mercy and to walk humbly with your God.', 'Micah 6:8', 'Standing on the Word: True manhood is found in humble obedience. I practice justice, extend mercy, and walk in reverent fellowship with my Creator.', 'identidad', 'hombres'),
('22421901-c499-4ac3-88bd-12870690c8cd', 187, 'Whatever you do, work at it with all your heart, as working for the Lord, not for human masters.', 'Colossians 3:23', 'Standing on the Word: I execute my work with excellence, honor, and tireless diligence. I report directly to King Jesus, and His favor crowns my labor.', 'negocios', 'hombres'),
('3766090e-3612-4671-b3f1-1c7def594043', 188, 'Now the Lord is the Spirit, and where the Spirit of the Lord is, there is freedom.', '2 Corinthians 3:17', 'Where the Spirit of the Lord is, there is absolute freedom. Every chain of addiction, fear, and condemnation is broken off my life today.', 'holy_spirit', 'hombres'),
('85735c4f-c9b2-4dd1-b1ec-146b0e9b44f1', 189, 'Be alert and of sober mind. Your enemy the devil prowls around like a roaring lion looking for someone to devour. Resist him, standing firm in the faith.', '1 Peter 5:8-9', 'Standing on the Word: I stay spiritually vigilant and sober-minded. When the enemy roars, I roar back with the truth of God\'s Word and stand victorious.', 'valentia', 'hombres'),
('144a7888-d3c7-4ba3-b005-aa90877c9450', 190, 'But as for me and my household, we will serve the Lord.', 'Joshua 24:15', 'Standing on the Word: As the spiritual patriarch of my home, I make a holy decree: my house belongs to Jesus. We will honor, worship, and serve Him forever.', 'familia', 'hombres'),
('377e3db8-9808-458a-811f-7d6d6ed9288c', 191, 'The weapons we fight with are not the weapons of the world. On the contrary, they have divine power to demolish strongholds.', '2 Corinthians 10:4', 'Standing on the Word: I wield heavenly firepower through prayer, the Word, and faith. Mental strongholds, generational addictions, and fears are demolished.', 'batallas', 'hombres'),
('9908818b-ed7f-47d4-bfc1-2b0bd7b31773', 192, 'Don’t be afraid of them. Remember the Lord, who is great and awesome, and fight for your families, your sons and your daughters, your wives and your homes.', 'Nehemiah 4:14', 'Standing on the Word: I will never back down when defending what God gave me. I fight in faith for my family, my marriage, and my legacy.', 'liderazgo', 'hombres'),
('ddf8c41d-860e-4744-a796-b601ae90a132', 193, 'The Spirit of the Lord is on me, because he has anointed me to proclaim good news to the poor. He has sent me to proclaim freedom for the prisoners and recovery of sight for the blind.', 'Luke 4:18-19', 'The anointing of the Holy Spirit rests upon my life. I am empowered to proclaim liberty, bring healing to wounded hearts, and advance the Kingdom of God with authority.', 'holy_spirit', 'hombres'),
('bb5671a7-dab6-4ac0-a6c4-ae1e608f78d7', 194, 'Let us throw off everything that hinders and the sin that so easily entangles. And let us run with perseverance the race marked out for us, fixing our eyes on Jesus.', 'Hebrews 12:1-2', 'Standing on the Word: I cast away every weight and distraction. With my eyes locked onto Christ, I run my race with relentless grit and endurance.', 'fortaleza', 'hombres'),
('707a1d41-cf64-4731-a84c-926da5bbb57d', 195, 'But remember the Lord your God, for it is he who gives you the ability to produce wealth.', 'Deuteronomy 8:18', 'Standing on the Word: God is the author of my capacity to create value and wealth. I manage His resources with wisdom, generosity, and Kingdom purpose.', 'provision', 'hombres'),
('83f0d9a3-f9cd-4bd1-a696-41d475b1b4a7', 196, 'Yet he did not waver through unbelief regarding the promise of God, but was strengthened in his faith and gave glory to God, being fully persuaded.', 'Romans 4:20-21', 'Standing on the Word: Like Abraham, I refuse to waver in doubt. God\'s promise is certain, and my faith gives Him immense glory as I wait on His fulfillment.', 'fe', 'hombres'),
('bc3b8801-8819-4cd9-95cb-2cb12bef276a', 197, 'Though an army besiege me, my heart will not fear; though war break out against me, even then I will be confident.', 'Psalm 27:3', 'Standing on the Word: Surrounded by pressures and deadlines, my inner man remains at rest. The Peace of God rules like a sentinel in my soul.', 'paz', 'hombres'),
('e914b0a4-aa39-46ec-948f-2ae812af10d8', 198, 'And you also were included in Christ when you heard the message of truth... having believed, you were marked in him with a seal, the promised Holy Spirit.', 'Ephesians 1:13-14', 'I am sealed for eternity by the Holy Spirit of promise. My inheritance is guaranteed, my salvation is secure, and my identity in Christ is untouchable.', 'holy_spirit', 'hombres'),
('5d8dc083-81ee-4cf3-a2fe-55ef6f169ee7', 199, 'Praise the Lord, my soul, and forget not all his benefits—who forgives all your sins and heals all your diseases.', 'Psalm 103:2-3', 'Standing on the Word: God restores my physical vitality and mends my internal battles. I walk in divine health and renewed vigor to complete my assignment.', 'sanidad', 'hombres'),
('7abe385a-94bd-4e8e-ada2-9b970499c621', 200, 'Enter his gates with thanksgiving and his courts with praise; give thanks to him and praise his name.', 'Psalm 100:4', 'Standing on the Word: I start my day by lifting up the Name of Jesus. A warrior\'s greatest weapon is a thankful spirit that praises God in advance of victory.', 'gratitud', 'hombres');
