('90150d10-2793-4a10-bfca-b2a963b28f32', 203, 'The Spirit of the Lord will rest on him—the Spirit of wisdom and of understanding, the Spirit of counsel and of might, the Spirit of the knowledge and fear of the Lord.', 'Isaiah 11:2', 'The sevenfold Spirit of God rests upon me: wisdom for decisions, understanding for complex matters, counsel in uncertainty, and supernatural might for the battle.', 'holy_spirit', 'hombres'),
