('27a453ce-fe6e-4b91-a697-b47f3e482ee5', 207, 'Join with me in suffering, like a good soldier of Christ Jesus.', '2 Timothy 2:3', 'As a man of God, I speak life: I embrace discipline and sacrifice. Like a focused soldier, I refuse civilian distractions and run my race to please my King.', 'disciplina', 'hombres'),
('7d445a89-23fb-4fa2-8586-659686332d05', 208, 'Whoever believes in me, as Scripture has said, rivers of living water will flow from within them. By this he meant the Spirit, whom those who believed in him were later to receive.', 'John 7:38-39', 'Rivers of living water surge from my innermost being. The Holy Spirit refreshes my soul, revives my home, and brings spiritual vitality wherever I go.', 'holy_spirit', 'hombres'),
('d854a34b-d2f3-4680-8671-dcaca9bb31c9', 209, 'It is God who arms me with strength and keeps my way secure.', 'Psalm 18:32', 'As a man of God, I speak life: God equips my spirit with supernatural stamina. He clears my path of traps and keeps my footing firm on the heights.', 'fortaleza', 'hombres'),
('34fbcbe3-0005-43f0-8838-3f8e4240fa85', 210, 'Trust in the Lord with all your heart and lean not on your own understanding; in all your ways submit to him, and he will make your paths straight.', 'Proverbs 3:5-6', 'As a man of God, I speak life: I surrender my human logic to God\'s higher wisdom. In every business venture and life decision, He aligns my steps and straightens my path.', 'proposito', 'hombres'),
('40111a15-48dc-48db-b8c5-4bd579ef8cef', 211, 'He has shown you, O mortal, what is good. And what does the Lord require of you? To act justly and to love mercy and to walk humbly with your God.', 'Micah 6:8', 'As a man of God, I speak life: True manhood is found in humble obedience. I practice justice, extend mercy, and walk in reverent fellowship with my Creator.', 'identidad', 'hombres'),
('78bb8ea7-a8d5-4d35-ab1e-0249ff493f06', 212, 'Whatever you do, work at it with all your heart, as working for the Lord, not for human masters.', 'Colossians 3:23', 'As a man of God, I speak life: I execute my work with excellence, honor, and tireless diligence. I report directly to King Jesus, and His favor crowns my labor.', 'negocios', 'hombres'),
('a398f526-7d6c-4509-b072-a6617184f7d8', 213, 'May the God of hope fill you with all joy and peace as you trust in him, so that you may overflow with hope by the power of the Holy Spirit.', 'Romans 15:13', 'I overflow with vibrant hope today through the power of the Holy Spirit. Despair is cast out, and divine optimism anchors my heart.', 'holy_spirit', 'hombres'),
('d18878f7-d090-4ac7-ad2c-8f57b50fed95', 214, 'Be alert and of sober mind. Your enemy the devil prowls around like a roaring lion looking for someone to devour. Resist him, standing firm in the faith.', '1 Peter 5:8-9', 'As a man of God, I speak life: I stay spiritually vigilant and sober-minded. When the enemy roars, I roar back with the truth of God\'s Word and stand victorious.', 'valentia', 'hombres'),
('bfdfd99a-4958-4d1b-b7db-ed1af8611180', 215, 'But as for me and my household, we will serve the Lord.', 'Joshua 24:15', 'As a man of God, I speak life: As the spiritual patriarch of my home, I make a holy decree: my house belongs to Jesus. We will honor, worship, and serve Him forever.', 'familia', 'hombres'),
