('11cccd76-525b-499b-b75b-bc98085d4c5b', 218, 'These are the things God has revealed to us by his Spirit. The Spirit searches all things, even the deep things of God.', '1 Corinthians 2:10-12', 'The Holy Spirit searches the deep mysteries of the Father’s heart and reveals them to me. I receive heavenly insight, divine vision, and spiritual discernment.', 'holy_spirit', 'hombres'),
('1a589f03-4cdb-4087-a2ac-f58aced9f86c', 219, 'Let us throw off everything that hinders and the sin that so easily entangles. And let us run with perseverance the race marked out for us, fixing our eyes on Jesus.', 'Hebrews 12:1-2', 'As a man of God, I speak life: I cast away every weight and distraction. With my eyes locked onto Christ, I run my race with relentless grit and endurance.', 'fortaleza', 'hombres'),
