('bb224897-ba31-4cf0-b693-6c812403fbc7', 223, 'Not by might nor by power, but by my Spirit, says the Lord Almighty.', 'Zechariah 4:6', 'The mountains before me will not fall by human striving or raw muscle, but by the breath and power of the Holy Spirit. God is making a smooth way forward.', 'holy_spirit', 'hombres'),
