('7c0e3ac2-eac9-436f-872e-3d3d0131b931', 306, 'Finally, be strong in the Lord and in his mighty power. Put on the full armor of God, so that you can take your stand against the devil’s schemes.', 'Ephesians 6:10-11', 'Standing on the Word: I strap on the full armor of God daily. I do not fight in my own flesh, but stand immovable in the almighty power of Jesus Christ.', 'batallas', 'hombres'),
('2a9c9382-7bac-4a21-8d33-0416b95f402f', 307, 'Join with me in suffering, like a good soldier of Christ Jesus.', '2 Timothy 2:3', 'Standing on the Word: I embrace discipline and sacrifice. Like a focused soldier, I refuse civilian distractions and run my race to please my King.', 'disciplina', 'hombres'),
('eaa16245-de6c-4816-9fb1-07f03f9c8134', 308, 'But when he, the Spirit of truth, comes, he will guide you into all the truth. He will not speak on his own; he will speak only what he hears, and he will tell you what is yet to come.', 'John 16:13', 'The Spirit of Truth guides my every step. I do not walk in confusion or second-guessing; the Holy Spirit illuminates my path and reveals God’s wisdom to my spirit.', 'holy_spirit', 'hombres'),
('16c7865b-24a1-4973-a6be-70794bab01ec', 309, 'It is God who arms me with strength and keeps my way secure.', 'Psalm 18:32', 'Standing on the Word: God equips my spirit with supernatural stamina. He clears my path of traps and keeps my footing firm on the heights.', 'fortaleza', 'hombres'),
('ed7760ac-1fea-422f-901c-12b35063bd54', 310, 'Trust in the Lord with all your heart and lean not on your own understanding; in all your ways submit to him, and he will make your paths straight.', 'Proverbs 3:5-6', 'Standing on the Word: I surrender my human logic to God\'s higher wisdom. In every business venture and life decision, He aligns my steps and straightens my path.', 'proposito', 'hombres'),
('e15237ea-e1d4-4f9d-bf02-0b71f9ecf762', 311, 'He has shown you, O mortal, what is good. And what does the Lord require of you? To act justly and to love mercy and to walk humbly with your God.', 'Micah 6:8', 'Standing on the Word: True manhood is found in humble obedience. I practice justice, extend mercy, and walk in reverent fellowship with my Creator.', 'identidad', 'hombres'),
('6a562fe9-3dee-4444-b919-7fd285f41747', 312, 'Whatever you do, work at it with all your heart, as working for the Lord, not for human masters.', 'Colossians 3:23', 'Standing on the Word: I execute my work with excellence, honor, and tireless diligence. I report directly to King Jesus, and His favor crowns my labor.', 'negocios', 'hombres'),
('296b1359-75ec-4410-bed0-d7890beada6b', 313, 'For those who are led by the Spirit of God are the children of God.', 'Romans 8:14', 'I am a true son of the living God, led daily by His Holy Spirit. My flesh does not dictate my direction; the Spirit guides my impulses, decisions, and heart.', 'holy_spirit', 'hombres'),
('599ce61c-0913-4cee-ada8-2b27cd383a67', 314, 'Be alert and of sober mind. Your enemy the devil prowls around like a roaring lion looking for someone to devour. Resist him, standing firm in the faith.', '1 Peter 5:8-9', 'Standing on the Word: I stay spiritually vigilant and sober-minded. When the enemy roars, I roar back with the truth of God\'s Word and stand victorious.', 'valentia', 'hombres'),
('284dddf6-e6b4-42c5-9c23-738204660794', 315, 'But as for me and my household, we will serve the Lord.', 'Joshua 24:15', 'Standing on the Word: As the spiritual patriarch of my home, I make a holy decree: my house belongs to Jesus. We will honor, worship, and serve Him forever.', 'familia', 'hombres'),
('977a3cad-e493-4b02-aee9-c47703d9bcdb', 316, 'The weapons we fight with are not the weapons of the world. On the contrary, they have divine power to demolish strongholds.', '2 Corinthians 10:4', 'Standing on the Word: I wield heavenly firepower through prayer, the Word, and faith. Mental strongholds, generational addictions, and fears are demolished.', 'batallas', 'hombres'),
('b96174c0-9b31-4adf-a47d-762dd567b4ff', 317, 'Don’t be afraid of them. Remember the Lord, who is great and awesome, and fight for your families, your sons and your daughters, your wives and your homes.', 'Nehemiah 4:14', 'Standing on the Word: I will never back down when defending what God gave me. I fight in faith for my family, my marriage, and my legacy.', 'liderazgo', 'hombres'),
('cbbcaeb3-9c53-4df2-8c09-884bc3ebee9f', 318, 'In the same way, the Spirit helps us in our weakness. We do not know what we ought to pray for, but the Spirit himself intercedes for us through wordless groans.', 'Romans 8:26', 'When I am weak or do not know what to pray, the Holy Spirit carries my petitions. His divine intercession aligns my prayers perfectly with the will of the Father.', 'holy_spirit', 'hombres'),
('7e9959cd-9aef-4b43-8c42-9e81f13340e0', 319, 'Let us throw off everything that hinders and the sin that so easily entangles. And let us run with perseverance the race marked out for us, fixing our eyes on Jesus.', 'Hebrews 12:1-2', 'Standing on the Word: I cast away every weight and distraction. With my eyes locked onto Christ, I run my race with relentless grit and endurance.', 'fortaleza', 'hombres'),
('38956e2e-9ba7-4646-9db8-2ab26c198b51', 320, 'But remember the Lord your God, for it is he who gives you the ability to produce wealth.', 'Deuteronomy 8:18', 'Standing on the Word: God is the author of my capacity to create value and wealth. I manage His resources with wisdom, generosity, and Kingdom purpose.', 'provision', 'hombres'),
('00ca98ac-7999-4973-b0e6-75305c654325', 321, 'Yet he did not waver through unbelief regarding the promise of God, but was strengthened in his faith and gave glory to God, being fully persuaded.', 'Romans 4:20-21', 'Standing on the Word: Like Abraham, I refuse to waver in doubt. God\'s promise is certain, and my faith gives Him immense glory as I wait on His fulfillment.', 'fe', 'hombres'),
('c3f187e1-f074-4590-a798-12ba0974b246', 322, 'Though an army besiege me, my heart will not fear; though war break out against me, even then I will be confident.', 'Psalm 27:3', 'Standing on the Word: Surrounded by pressures and deadlines, my inner man remains at rest. The Peace of God rules like a sentinel in my soul.', 'paz', 'hombres'),
('bf74f2d4-e607-429f-836b-7f198dbc6d8f', 323, 'But the fruit of the Spirit is love, joy, peace, forbearance, kindness, goodness, faithfulness, gentleness and self-control. Against such things there is no law.', 'Galatians 5:22-23', 'The character of Jesus flourishes within me. By the Holy Spirit, I walk in supernatural love, unshakeable joy, and masculine self-control in every pressure.', 'holy_spirit', 'hombres'),
('da604d23-3670-402c-aa08-f85d9ddc31a0', 324, 'Praise the Lord, my soul, and forget not all his benefits—who forgives all your sins and heals all your diseases.', 'Psalm 103:2-3', 'Standing on the Word: God restores my physical vitality and mends my internal battles. I walk in divine health and renewed vigor to complete my assignment.', 'sanidad', 'hombres'),
('472531d5-21ba-4015-95ec-b92e78424af9', 325, 'Enter his gates with thanksgiving and his courts with praise; give thanks to him and praise his name.', 'Psalm 100:4', 'Standing on the Word: I start my day by lifting up the Name of Jesus. A warrior\'s greatest weapon is a thankful spirit that praises God in advance of victory.', 'gratitud', 'hombres'),
('6964c1f2-796d-4e1b-bc67-b9562e3542ff', 326, 'Have I not commanded you? Be strong and courageous. Do not be afraid; do not be discouraged, for the Lord your God will be with you wherever you go.', 'Joshua 1:9', 'As a man of God, I speak life: Fear has no dominion over my decisions. I step into every battle with warrior courage because the Lord of Hosts marches with me.', 'valentia', 'hombres'),
('febd976e-1807-4068-b9d1-90ddba84a3ef', 327, 'Be on your guard; stand firm in the faith; be courageous; be strong. Do everything in love.', '1 Corinthians 16:13', 'As a man of God, I speak life: I stand guard over my convictions and my family. I am rooted in unshakeable faith and divine strength, acting with courageous love.', 'fortaleza', 'hombres'),
('aa5594b0-ff40-4331-a3b4-a948eef361d9', 328, 'Do you not know that your bodies are temples of the Holy Spirit, who is in you, whom you have received from God? You are not your own; you were bought at a price.', '1 Corinthians 6:19-20', 'My body is a holy sanctuary of the Spirit of God. I honor God with my eyes, my thoughts, and my physical strength, refusing every snare of impurity.', 'holy_spirit', 'hombres'),
('e69eafc0-b0ad-4cab-bd9c-4d731cf1eabd', 329, 'As iron sharpens iron, so one person sharpens another.', 'Proverbs 27:17', 'As a man of God, I speak life: I surround myself with godly brothers and speak wisdom into those I lead. We sharpen one another for Kingdom greatness.', 'liderazgo', 'hombres'),
('52f5e4a9-fd59-4527-93e7-999d912eca82', 330, 'Praise be to the Lord my Rock, who trains my hands for war, my fingers for battle.', 'Psalm 144:1', 'As a man of God, I speak life: The Lord is my Rock and trainer in spiritual warfare. Through prayer and scripture, every enemy scheme formed against my house is broken.', 'batallas', 'hombres'),
('e8811039-5761-432d-92ad-2044461a65bb', 331, 'Finally, be strong in the Lord and in his mighty power. Put on the full armor of God, so that you can take your stand against the devil’s schemes.', 'Ephesians 6:10-11', 'As a man of God, I speak life: I strap on the full armor of God daily. I do not fight in my own flesh, but stand immovable in the almighty power of Jesus Christ.', 'batallas', 'hombres'),
('b33701bf-590c-4e6d-bfc3-612d87352ee1', 332, 'Join with me in suffering, like a good soldier of Christ Jesus.', '2 Timothy 2:3', 'As a man of God, I speak life: I embrace discipline and sacrifice. Like a focused soldier, I refuse civilian distractions and run my race to please my King.', 'disciplina', 'hombres'),
('4c646acd-6fdd-4fdc-803b-af7ccf37ec51', 333, 'For the Spirit God gave us does not make us timid, but gives us power, love and self-discipline.', '2 Timothy 1:7', 'Timidity and cowardice have no room in my soul. The Holy Spirit fuels me with holy courage, boundless agape love, and laser-sharp self-mastery.', 'holy_spirit', 'hombres'),
('414dc2b0-8bf0-4719-8030-4d92fdd6197b', 334, 'It is God who arms me with strength and keeps my way secure.', 'Psalm 18:32', 'As a man of God, I speak life: God equips my spirit with supernatural stamina. He clears my path of traps and keeps my footing firm on the heights.', 'fortaleza', 'hombres'),
('2bc91c7c-34ff-4d32-990f-e7b0cc9352da', 335, 'Trust in the Lord with all your heart and lean not on your own understanding; in all your ways submit to him, and he will make your paths straight.', 'Proverbs 3:5-6', 'As a man of God, I speak life: I surrender my human logic to God\'s higher wisdom. In every business venture and life decision, He aligns my steps and straightens my path.', 'proposito', 'hombres'),
('f25282de-016b-44b2-9060-5e9da33cb3c9', 336, 'He has shown you, O mortal, what is good. And what does the Lord require of you? To act justly and to love mercy and to walk humbly with your God.', 'Micah 6:8', 'As a man of God, I speak life: True manhood is found in humble obedience. I practice justice, extend mercy, and walk in reverent fellowship with my Creator.', 'identidad', 'hombres'),
('e9eb5edf-e804-441e-b216-39a5989b7de0', 337, 'Whatever you do, work at it with all your heart, as working for the Lord, not for human masters.', 'Colossians 3:23', 'As a man of God, I speak life: I execute my work with excellence, honor, and tireless diligence. I report directly to King Jesus, and His favor crowns my labor.', 'negocios', 'hombres'),
('3a9da17d-61f2-4b7d-9e51-7cd897ae7644', 338, 'Now the Lord is the Spirit, and where the Spirit of the Lord is, there is freedom.', '2 Corinthians 3:17', 'Where the Spirit of the Lord is, there is absolute freedom. Every chain of addiction, fear, and condemnation is broken off my life today.', 'holy_spirit', 'hombres'),
('27ae45da-fc6b-43ae-8d4b-bb85a5b5368f', 339, 'Be alert and of sober mind. Your enemy the devil prowls around like a roaring lion looking for someone to devour. Resist him, standing firm in the faith.', '1 Peter 5:8-9', 'As a man of God, I speak life: I stay spiritually vigilant and sober-minded. When the enemy roars, I roar back with the truth of God\'s Word and stand victorious.', 'valentia', 'hombres'),
('973500c1-929a-4a9a-88ea-699298c755bc', 340, 'But as for me and my household, we will serve the Lord.', 'Joshua 24:15', 'As a man of God, I speak life: As the spiritual patriarch of my home, I make a holy decree: my house belongs to Jesus. We will honor, worship, and serve Him forever.', 'familia', 'hombres'),
('d230849d-4491-4cbd-8b1e-d966864c5f8e', 341, 'The weapons we fight with are not the weapons of the world. On the contrary, they have divine power to demolish strongholds.', '2 Corinthians 10:4', 'As a man of God, I speak life: I wield heavenly firepower through prayer, the Word, and faith. Mental strongholds, generational addictions, and fears are demolished.', 'batallas', 'hombres'),
('e2eeb425-fa46-4463-9b17-c3f79cc9e036', 342, 'Don’t be afraid of them. Remember the Lord, who is great and awesome, and fight for your families, your sons and your daughters, your wives and your homes.', 'Nehemiah 4:14', 'As a man of God, I speak life: I will never back down when defending what God gave me. I fight in faith for my family, my marriage, and my legacy.', 'liderazgo', 'hombres'),
('16a01cef-2873-4851-a422-d1ef66eb0ea6', 343, 'The Spirit of the Lord is on me, because he has anointed me to proclaim good news to the poor. He has sent me to proclaim freedom for the prisoners and recovery of sight for the blind.', 'Luke 4:18-19', 'The anointing of the Holy Spirit rests upon my life. I am empowered to proclaim liberty, bring healing to wounded hearts, and advance the Kingdom of God with authority.', 'holy_spirit', 'hombres'),
('9e21bc2e-de55-4812-912e-bb53b181f4c3', 344, 'Let us throw off everything that hinders and the sin that so easily entangles. And let us run with perseverance the race marked out for us, fixing our eyes on Jesus.', 'Hebrews 12:1-2', 'As a man of God, I speak life: I cast away every weight and distraction. With my eyes locked onto Christ, I run my race with relentless grit and endurance.', 'fortaleza', 'hombres'),
('1e57e5c1-0040-4f4e-a7e6-03c9dfffbf2e', 345, 'But remember the Lord your God, for it is he who gives you the ability to produce wealth.', 'Deuteronomy 8:18', 'As a man of God, I speak life: God is the author of my capacity to create value and wealth. I manage His resources with wisdom, generosity, and Kingdom purpose.', 'provision', 'hombres'),
('377147c8-58bd-4d61-9d39-b973f662d5a0', 346, 'Yet he did not waver through unbelief regarding the promise of God, but was strengthened in his faith and gave glory to God, being fully persuaded.', 'Romans 4:20-21', 'As a man of God, I speak life: Like Abraham, I refuse to waver in doubt. God\'s promise is certain, and my faith gives Him immense glory as I wait on His fulfillment.', 'fe', 'hombres'),
('7af5c0d1-daa7-4780-9a63-945598c0cba9', 347, 'Though an army besiege me, my heart will not fear; though war break out against me, even then I will be confident.', 'Psalm 27:3', 'As a man of God, I speak life: Surrounded by pressures and deadlines, my inner man remains at rest. The Peace of God rules like a sentinel in my soul.', 'paz', 'hombres'),
('82c3379c-c479-4e6f-96ff-b4a07ca77284', 348, 'And you also were included in Christ when you heard the message of truth... having believed, you were marked in him with a seal, the promised Holy Spirit.', 'Ephesians 1:13-14', 'I am sealed for eternity by the Holy Spirit of promise. My inheritance is guaranteed, my salvation is secure, and my identity in Christ is untouchable.', 'holy_spirit', 'hombres'),
('71031be0-ecff-4117-8b46-76b5d1b9e722', 349, 'Praise the Lord, my soul, and forget not all his benefits—who forgives all your sins and heals all your diseases.', 'Psalm 103:2-3', 'As a man of God, I speak life: God restores my physical vitality and mends my internal battles. I walk in divine health and renewed vigor to complete my assignment.', 'sanidad', 'hombres'),
('4b8c8805-ab14-4442-8d8a-86fc95f6dba2', 350, 'Enter his gates with thanksgiving and his courts with praise; give thanks to him and praise his name.', 'Psalm 100:4', 'As a man of God, I speak life: I start my day by lifting up the Name of Jesus. A warrior\'s greatest weapon is a thankful spirit that praises God in advance of victory.', 'gratitud', 'hombres');
INSERT IGNORE INTO declarations (id, day_number, scripture_text, scripture_reference, declaration_text, topic, gender) VALUES
('677dd88b-f64c-4bb8-8139-e411711500bb', 351, 'Have I not commanded you? Be strong and courageous. Do not be afraid; do not be discouraged, for the Lord your God will be with you wherever you go.', 'Joshua 1:9', 'By faith in God\'s unbreakable covenant: Fear has no dominion over my decisions. I step into every battle with warrior courage because the Lord of Hosts marches with me.', 'valentia', 'hombres'),
('65bc6235-b765-4595-8dd6-d225c5b7c38b', 352, 'Be on your guard; stand firm in the faith; be courageous; be strong. Do everything in love.', '1 Corinthians 16:13', 'By faith in God\'s unbreakable covenant: I stand guard over my convictions and my family. I am rooted in unshakeable faith and divine strength, acting with courageous love.', 'fortaleza', 'hombres'),
('b02691df-c024-4b9f-ae4b-a5dec68019da', 353, 'The Spirit of the Lord will rest on him—the Spirit of wisdom and of understanding, the Spirit of counsel and of might, the Spirit of the knowledge and fear of the Lord.', 'Isaiah 11:2', 'The sevenfold Spirit of God rests upon me: wisdom for decisions, understanding for complex matters, counsel in uncertainty, and supernatural might for the battle.', 'holy_spirit', 'hombres'),
('25007e2f-998a-464d-94aa-7d1cd0853bc4', 354, 'As iron sharpens iron, so one person sharpens another.', 'Proverbs 27:17', 'By faith in God\'s unbreakable covenant: I surround myself with godly brothers and speak wisdom into those I lead. We sharpen one another for Kingdom greatness.', 'liderazgo', 'hombres'),
('b8877c22-ebfe-4d49-9f7d-20ab07f45fea', 355, 'Praise be to the Lord my Rock, who trains my hands for war, my fingers for battle.', 'Psalm 144:1', 'By faith in God\'s unbreakable covenant: The Lord is my Rock and trainer in spiritual warfare. Through prayer and scripture, every enemy scheme formed against my house is broken.', 'batallas', 'hombres'),
('2dece3af-52c5-4c9f-b552-8cc3bbe95411', 356, 'Finally, be strong in the Lord and in his mighty power. Put on the full armor of God, so that you can take your stand against the devil’s schemes.', 'Ephesians 6:10-11', 'By faith in God\'s unbreakable covenant: I strap on the full armor of God daily. I do not fight in my own flesh, but stand immovable in the almighty power of Jesus Christ.', 'batallas', 'hombres'),
('73a0504b-4a70-4307-8180-7f6d7a9b4b92', 357, 'Join with me in suffering, like a good soldier of Christ Jesus.', '2 Timothy 2:3', 'By faith in God\'s unbreakable covenant: I embrace discipline and sacrifice. Like a focused soldier, I refuse civilian distractions and run my race to please my King.', 'disciplina', 'hombres'),
('b87ad322-d5f2-4b98-a99e-123309cc5c86', 358, 'Whoever believes in me, as Scripture has said, rivers of living water will flow from within them. By this he meant the Spirit, whom those who believed in him were later to receive.', 'John 7:38-39', 'Rivers of living water surge from my innermost being. The Holy Spirit refreshes my soul, revives my home, and brings spiritual vitality wherever I go.', 'holy_spirit', 'hombres'),
('75f3e609-077b-4bb0-aa7a-cd2c5c929805', 359, 'It is God who arms me with strength and keeps my way secure.', 'Psalm 18:32', 'By faith in God\'s unbreakable covenant: God equips my spirit with supernatural stamina. He clears my path of traps and keeps my footing firm on the heights.', 'fortaleza', 'hombres'),
('86bfda8e-8fcf-4b39-aad5-c020f9585306', 360, 'Trust in the Lord with all your heart and lean not on your own understanding; in all your ways submit to him, and he will make your paths straight.', 'Proverbs 3:5-6', 'By faith in God\'s unbreakable covenant: I surrender my human logic to God\'s higher wisdom. In every business venture and life decision, He aligns my steps and straightens my path.', 'proposito', 'hombres'),
('4b54b5ab-995e-45f5-bb5a-72d56fbb7f0a', 361, 'He has shown you, O mortal, what is good. And what does the Lord require of you? To act justly and to love mercy and to walk humbly with your God.', 'Micah 6:8', 'By faith in God\'s unbreakable covenant: True manhood is found in humble obedience. I practice justice, extend mercy, and walk in reverent fellowship with my Creator.', 'identidad', 'hombres'),
('ffcecb06-af76-4470-b1c9-d2b68509d085', 362, 'Whatever you do, work at it with all your heart, as working for the Lord, not for human masters.', 'Colossians 3:23', 'By faith in God\'s unbreakable covenant: I execute my work with excellence, honor, and tireless diligence. I report directly to King Jesus, and His favor crowns my labor.', 'negocios', 'hombres'),
('a42f3a1d-7742-48f7-b957-808910163083', 363, 'May the God of hope fill you with all joy and peace as you trust in him, so that you may overflow with hope by the power of the Holy Spirit.', 'Romans 15:13', 'I overflow with vibrant hope today through the power of the Holy Spirit. Despair is cast out, and divine optimism anchors my heart.', 'holy_spirit', 'hombres'),
('526aa93c-8f17-4744-9c27-b2c67d90107c', 364, 'Be alert and of sober mind. Your enemy the devil prowls around like a roaring lion looking for someone to devour. Resist him, standing firm in the faith.', '1 Peter 5:8-9', 'By faith in God\'s unbreakable covenant: I stay spiritually vigilant and sober-minded. When the enemy roars, I roar back with the truth of God\'s Word and stand victorious.', 'valentia', 'hombres'),
('d428b9e6-3f78-40b5-87eb-9f0349ae8603', 365, 'But as for me and my household, we will serve the Lord.', 'Joshua 24:15', 'By faith in God\'s unbreakable covenant: As the spiritual patriarch of my home, I make a holy decree: my house belongs to Jesus. We will honor, worship, and serve Him forever.', 'familia', 'hombres'),
('4d84bfe8-2829-483f-8370-202580e1e14c', 1, 'She is clothed with strength and dignity; she can laugh at the days to come.', 'Proverbs 31:25', 'I am clothed in celestial dignity and unwavering grace. Tomorrow holds no terror for me; I smile at the future with divine joy.', 'identidad', 'mujeres'),
('ffa7ea51-3608-4e2f-b0c4-56b9dea6de2d', 2, 'God is within her, she will not fall; God will help her at break of day.', 'Psalm 46:5', 'The Living God dwells inside me; I will never collapse under pressure. His dawn brings fresh mercy, breakthrough, and steady peace.', 'fortaleza', 'mujeres'),
('df16276d-c4d7-46ef-b927-77afd63a026e', 3, 'But the Advocate, the Holy Spirit, whom the Father will send in my name, will teach you all things and will remind you of everything I have said to you.', 'John 14:26', 'The Holy Spirit is my personal Advocate and Comforter. He teaches me divine truth, whispers peace to my soul, and constantly reminds me of Jesus’ tender promises.', 'holy_spirit', 'mujeres'),
('1b8ff140-622a-4670-b9c0-57427dfa6669', 4, 'Rather, it should be that of your inner self, the unfading beauty of a gentle and quiet spirit, which is of great worth in God’s sight.', '1 Peter 3:4', 'My true beauty is eternal, rooted in the gentle calm of God\'s presence. I am of priceless value to my Father in heaven.', 'amorpropio', 'mujeres'),
('44d22748-dedf-4280-bd1e-93d7590806e2', 5, 'For you created my inmost being; you knit me together in my mother’s womb. I praise you because I am fearfully and wonderfully made.', 'Psalm 139:13-14', 'I am God\'s intentional design, woven with royal precision. I silence comparison; I celebrate who God shaped me to be.', 'identidad', 'mujeres'),
('cffda79a-6b70-436e-8f82-fef3d2caa95d', 6, 'And who knows but that you have come to your royal position for such a time as this?', 'Esther 4:14', 'I am planted in this generation on assignment. God has positioned my life for such a time as this, and I step up with holy boldness.', 'proposito', 'mujeres'),
('027b997a-d073-45d8-92f1-6181f153f479', 7, 'You are altogether beautiful, my darling; there is no flaw in you.', 'Song of Songs 4:7', 'In the eyes of my Savior, I am cleansed, cherished, and complete. Insecurity and shame have no voice in my identity.', 'amorpropio', 'mujeres'),
('202411f8-969d-4ec7-822d-e9709f660332', 8, 'The Spirit you received brought about your adoption to sonship. And by him we cry, "Abba, Father." The Spirit himself testifies with our spirit that we are God’s children.', 'Romans 8:15-16', 'I am a deeply cherished daughter of the King. The Holy Spirit constantly affirms within my spirit that I am loved, accepted, and forever secure in my Father’s arms.', 'holy_spirit', 'mujeres'),
('21d18a6a-290e-41ff-9f98-f0acb5dc76b7', 9, 'The Lord your God is with you, the Mighty Warrior who saves. He will take great delight in you; he will rejoice over you with singing.', 'Zephaniah 3:17', 'The Lord takes personal delight in me. He quietens my anxieties with His tender affection and sings songs of deliverance over my soul.', 'amorpropio', 'mujeres'),
('ad59da2f-9136-49a9-90e2-122d9e9ede69', 10, 'The Lord appeared to us in the past, saying: \'I have loved you with an everlasting love; I have drawn you with unfailing kindness.\'', 'Jeremiah 31:3', 'God\'s love for me will never run dry. His unfailing kindness leads me out of disappointment into restorative abundance.', 'restauracion', 'mujeres'),
('2dec9c5b-16a5-4ed7-a50f-8051d1c2503b', 11, 'Do not be anxious about anything, but in every situation, by prayer and petition, with thanksgiving, present your requests to God. And the peace of God will guard your hearts and minds.', 'Philippians 4:6-7', 'I release every worry into my Father\'s tender care. His supernatural serenity envelops my thoughts and guards my heart.', 'paz', 'mujeres'),
('6e47910a-2591-4d16-8440-08ab14be9abf', 12, 'He heals the brokenhearted and binds up their wounds.', 'Psalm 147:3', 'Jesus gently heals every tender place of my history. He turns deep heartache into a wellspring of empathy, wisdom, and beauty.', 'sanidad', 'mujeres'),
('1366cdc5-e4b1-4210-8ce4-273595ed488b', 13, 'But the fruit of the Spirit is love, joy, peace, forbearance, kindness, goodness, faithfulness, gentleness and self-control.', 'Galatians 5:22-23', 'The fragrant fruit of the Spirit adorns my life today. I overflow with Christlike kindness, gentle strength, unshakeable peace, and patient grace in my home and workplace.', 'holy_spirit', 'mujeres'),
('2945dd26-80be-422c-aa1c-41f31418d5a2', 14, 'Do not fear, for I have redeemed you; I have summoned you by name; you are mine.', 'Isaiah 43:1', 'I am known, cherished, and called by name by the Creator of the universe. I belong to Him, and I walk without fear.', 'identidad', 'mujeres'),
('ed2f693a-199c-405d-b867-261e98de7dd1', 15, 'Come to me, all you who are weary and burdened, and I will give you rest.', 'Matthew 11:28', 'I lay down the exhausting burden of trying to control everything. In Jesus\' presence, my soul finds true, refreshing rest.', 'paz', 'mujeres'),
('cbcd1fdf-b098-40bc-9400-222ca70acb50', 16, 'The Lord is my shepherd, I lack nothing. He makes me lie down in green pastures, he leads me beside quiet waters.', 'Psalm 23:1-2', 'The Good Shepherd attends to every detail of my life. He provides all I need and leads my soul into pastures of peace.', 'provision', 'mujeres'),
('bd2ed240-f23a-4cd6-9c9c-9ca60831fb19', 17, 'Those who hope in the Lord will renew their strength. They will soar on wings like eagles; they will run and not grow weary, they will walk and not be faint.', 'Isaiah 40:31', 'As I wait quietly before God, my inner strength is renewed. I rise above fatigue and soar in supernatural grace.', 'fortaleza', 'mujeres'),
('defda811-cb68-48ea-bae9-6fe8f4f6e909', 18, 'And we all, who with unveiled faces contemplate the Lord’s glory, are being transformed into his image with ever-increasing glory, which comes from the Lord, who is the Spirit.', '2 Corinthians 3:18', 'As I gaze upon Jesus, the Holy Spirit transforms me from glory to glory. Past wounds, insecurity, and shame are swallowed up in His radiant beauty.', 'holy_spirit', 'mujeres'),
('feb2f450-d720-4453-9015-119f45c0d019', 19, 'Heal me, Lord, and I will be healed; save me and I will be saved, for you are the one I praise.', 'Jeremiah 17:14', 'Divine healing cascades over my body and emotions. The Lord is my healer, and wholeness is my daily inheritance.', 'sanidad', 'mujeres'),
('d2d4ddb4-ea58-433e-a3c0-4c92eef3c06f', 20, 'Rejoice always, pray continually, give thanks in all circumstances; for this is God’s will for you in Christ Jesus.', '1 Thessalonians 5:16-18', 'I choose joy as my lifestyle. In every circumstance, thanksgiving sweetens my spirit and opens the windows of heaven.', 'gratitud', 'mujeres'),
('2c50a8fb-6e11-4154-891b-ee9da920a60e', 21, 'For I am convinced that neither death nor life... nor anything else in all creation, will be able to separate us from the love of God that is in Christ Jesus our Lord.', 'Romans 8:38-39', 'I am anchored in the unbreakable grip of God\'s love. Nothing in all creation can ever separate me from His embrace.', 'amorpropio', 'mujeres'),
('50ec3e37-44e9-4d69-8b17-33a7357a83e0', 22, 'For I know the plans I have for you, declares the Lord, plans to prosper you and not to harm you, plans to give you hope and a future.', 'Jeremiah 29:11', 'My future is bright with God\'s intentional favor. He is preparing a beautiful path of hope, fruitfulness, and purpose for me.', 'proposito', 'mujeres'),
('3d798fb7-5c87-4f71-9161-34a725b2a97d', 23, 'He saved us, not because of righteous things we had done, but because of his mercy. He saved us through the washing of rebirth and renewal by the Holy Spirit.', 'Titus 3:5', 'I am washed clean and daily renewed by the precious Holy Spirit. His grace makes all things fresh, pure, and full of divine hope in my life.', 'holy_spirit', 'mujeres'),
('758db241-a705-4f78-94c9-7f90f0bb337f', 24, 'For the Spirit God gave us does not make us timid, but gives us power, love and self-discipline.', '2 Timothy 1:7', 'I am not defined by anxiety or timidity. The Holy Spirit inside me is a fountain of bold love, wisdom, and inner power.', 'valentia', 'mujeres'),
('5fb1a36f-092c-4699-81ca-340ec840cb77', 25, 'To bestow on them a crown of beauty instead of ashes, the oil of joy instead of mourning, and a garment of praise instead of a spirit of despair.', 'Isaiah 61:3', 'The Lord crowns me with royal beauty for every ash of the past. Mourning is finished; joy and praise are my new garments.', 'restauracion', 'mujeres'),
('5e88fc22-30b3-4250-9b0b-f28c4854328c', 26, 'She is clothed with strength and dignity; she can laugh at the days to come.', 'Proverbs 31:25', 'Today my heart rests in this truth: I am clothed in celestial dignity and unwavering grace. Tomorrow holds no terror for me; I smile at the future with divine joy.', 'identidad', 'mujeres'),
('2fb88af7-5030-4bc7-9de9-f6acd6a5a304', 27, 'God is within her, she will not fall; God will help her at break of day.', 'Psalm 46:5', 'Today my heart rests in this truth: The Living God dwells inside me; I will never collapse under pressure. His dawn brings fresh mercy, breakthrough, and steady peace.', 'fortaleza', 'mujeres'),
('938ca490-23d7-4645-9105-2808260057d8', 28, 'And hope does not put us to shame, because God’s love has been poured out into our hearts through the Holy Spirit, who has been given to us.', 'Romans 5:5', 'The lavish, unconditional love of God is poured out lavishly into my heart by the Holy Spirit. Fear of rejection has no power over my thoughts.', 'holy_spirit', 'mujeres'),
('06c36f26-7c36-4775-b587-9e0c5553ea18', 29, 'Rather, it should be that of your inner self, the unfading beauty of a gentle and quiet spirit, which is of great worth in God’s sight.', '1 Peter 3:4', 'Today my heart rests in this truth: My true beauty is eternal, rooted in the gentle calm of God\'s presence. I am of priceless value to my Father in heaven.', 'amorpropio', 'mujeres'),
('7ad1fe4b-56d4-4d40-83fd-ad6419432f97', 30, 'For you created my inmost being; you knit me together in my mother’s womb. I praise you because I am fearfully and wonderfully made.', 'Psalm 139:13-14', 'Today my heart rests in this truth: I am God\'s intentional design, woven with royal precision. I silence comparison; I celebrate who God shaped me to be.', 'identidad', 'mujeres'),
('907bb189-484d-4186-a7da-67f870ff8fa6', 31, 'And who knows but that you have come to your royal position for such a time as this?', 'Esther 4:14', 'Today my heart rests in this truth: I am planted in this generation on assignment. God has positioned my life for such a time as this, and I step up with holy boldness.', 'proposito', 'mujeres'),
('d3dbba64-8755-456c-bb0a-12b97c5df985', 32, 'You are altogether beautiful, my darling; there is no flaw in you.', 'Song of Songs 4:7', 'Today my heart rests in this truth: In the eyes of my Savior, I am cleansed, cherished, and complete. Insecurity and shame have no voice in my identity.', 'amorpropio', 'mujeres'),
('07b1b45a-e94e-4e68-928f-a42894c3f296', 33, 'Teach me to do your will, for you are my God; may your good Spirit lead me on level ground.', 'Psalm 143:10', 'The gentle Holy Spirit leads my steps onto level ground. When the terrain seems steep or uncertain, His hand guides me safely and securely.', 'holy_spirit', 'mujeres'),
('8376986e-aa34-4a7b-8ee8-ae74df8da0d6', 34, 'The Lord your God is with you, the Mighty Warrior who saves. He will take great delight in you; he will rejoice over you with singing.', 'Zephaniah 3:17', 'Today my heart rests in this truth: The Lord takes personal delight in me. He quietens my anxieties with His tender affection and sings songs of deliverance over my soul.', 'amorpropio', 'mujeres'),
('e80c8abd-634d-47ef-9e26-ee229d8d1a97', 35, 'The Lord appeared to us in the past, saying: \'I have loved you with an everlasting love; I have drawn you with unfailing kindness.\'', 'Jeremiah 31:3', 'Today my heart rests in this truth: God\'s love for me will never run dry. His unfailing kindness leads me out of disappointment into restorative abundance.', 'restauracion', 'mujeres');
