('7a555e02-1321-4b07-88f2-b997ce0d0821', 38, 'Now to each one the manifestation of the Spirit is given for the common good.', '1 Corinthians 12:7', 'The Holy Spirit has uniquely gifted me with heavenly grace and wisdom. I steward my gifts to build up others, bring life, and glorify my Savior.', 'holy_spirit', 'mujeres'),
('d277eb9a-af2f-4662-8a5f-808afb0ab62e', 39, 'Do not fear, for I have redeemed you; I have summoned you by name; you are mine.', 'Isaiah 43:1', 'Today my heart rests in this truth: I am known, cherished, and called by name by the Creator of the universe. I belong to Him, and I walk without fear.', 'identidad', 'mujeres'),
