('03535638-e201-4842-a84a-203706901860', 45, 'Rejoice always, pray continually, give thanks in all circumstances; for this is God’s will for you in Christ Jesus.', '1 Thessalonians 5:16-18', 'Today my heart rests in this truth: I choose joy as my lifestyle. In every circumstance, thanksgiving sweetens my spirit and opens the windows of heaven.', 'gratitud', 'mujeres'),
