('44cea59c-0b58-4193-b015-28352606dc1c', 53, 'The angel answered, "The Holy Spirit will come on you, and the power of the Most High will overshadow you."', 'Luke 1:35', 'The Holy Spirit overshadows my life with His power and peace. What seems impossible in the natural will come to pass by His divine intervention.', 'holy_spirit', 'mujeres'),
