('0acc7402-91dc-4726-9d3c-2571c9bacaca', 56, 'And who knows but that you have come to your royal position for such a time as this?', 'Esther 4:14', 'With deep joy and assurance, I declare: I am planted in this generation on assignment. God has positioned my life for such a time as this, and I step up with holy boldness.', 'proposito', 'mujeres'),
