('be347995-a470-4dd0-ae28-54f52e703d3c', 59, 'The Lord your God is with you, the Mighty Warrior who saves. He will take great delight in you; he will rejoice over you with singing.', 'Zephaniah 3:17', 'With deep joy and assurance, I declare: The Lord takes personal delight in me. He quietens my anxieties with His tender affection and sings songs of deliverance over my soul.', 'amorpropio', 'mujeres'),
('f51a5ddd-1908-453e-aabc-e72ade3bce59', 60, 'The Lord appeared to us in the past, saying: \'I have loved you with an everlasting love; I have drawn you with unfailing kindness.\'', 'Jeremiah 31:3', 'With deep joy and assurance, I declare: God\'s love for me will never run dry. His unfailing kindness leads me out of disappointment into restorative abundance.', 'restauracion', 'mujeres'),
