('5f6c3558-7f0f-416d-8ed8-c7ec37b4d91a', 63, 'And if the Spirit of him who raised Jesus from the dead is living in you, he who raised Christ from the dead will also give life to your mortal bodies because of his Spirit who lives in you.', 'Romans 8:11', 'Resurrection life pulses through my mind, body, and spirit. The same Spirit who raised Jesus from the grave revitalizes every cell of my body and every dream in my heart.', 'holy_spirit', 'mujeres'),
('fee9cfcc-0626-44bb-9c28-38ee3fce427a', 64, 'Do not fear, for I have redeemed you; I have summoned you by name; you are mine.', 'Isaiah 43:1', 'With deep joy and assurance, I declare: I am known, cherished, and called by name by the Creator of the universe. I belong to Him, and I walk without fear.', 'identidad', 'mujeres'),
('6adce25f-3a02-4b61-bcb8-bddb1bc2aded', 65, 'Come to me, all you who are weary and burdened, and I will give you rest.', 'Matthew 11:28', 'With deep joy and assurance, I declare: I lay down the exhausting burden of trying to control everything. In Jesus\' presence, my soul finds true, refreshing rest.', 'paz', 'mujeres'),
