('39d3c3ab-1ea7-46e3-91db-f693a85dfb65', 73, 'Then the church... was strengthened. Living in the fear of the Lord and encouraged by the Holy Spirit, it increased in numbers.', 'Acts 9:31', 'My home and family are built up in the fear of the Lord and daily comforted by the Holy Spirit. We walk in divine unity, peace, and spiritual growth.', 'holy_spirit', 'mujeres'),
('0af89e42-ad76-4487-a9f2-d4c2713cf87b', 74, 'For the Spirit God gave us does not make us timid, but gives us power, love and self-discipline.', '2 Timothy 1:7', 'With deep joy and assurance, I declare: I am not defined by anxiety or timidity. The Holy Spirit inside me is a fountain of bold love, wisdom, and inner power.', 'valentia', 'mujeres'),
