('678f82cd-b564-40fb-9b5f-9ec83c834185', 188, 'Now to each one the manifestation of the Spirit is given for the common good.', '1 Corinthians 12:7', 'The Holy Spirit has uniquely gifted me with heavenly grace and wisdom. I steward my gifts to build up others, bring life, and glorify my Savior.', 'holy_spirit', 'mujeres'),
