('6416c303-72cd-423e-8361-acc16055bf2f', 197, 'For I know the plans I have for you, declares the Lord, plans to prosper you and not to harm you, plans to give you hope and a future.', 'Jeremiah 29:11', 'With deep joy and assurance, I declare: My future is bright with God\'s intentional favor. He is preparing a beautiful path of hope, fruitfulness, and purpose for me.', 'proposito', 'mujeres'),
('d382d4e6-c53d-4573-9490-6866d9ef34cb', 198, 'And I will ask the Father, and he will give you another advocate to help you and be with you forever—the Spirit of truth.', 'John 14:16-17', 'I will never walk alone. The Holy Spirit dwells inside me as an eternal Companion, Wise Counselor, and Faithful Guardian through every season.', 'holy_spirit', 'mujeres'),
('ded0b79e-5bb6-438b-b147-f2ee6fc9475a', 199, 'For the Spirit God gave us does not make us timid, but gives us power, love and self-discipline.', '2 Timothy 1:7', 'With deep joy and assurance, I declare: I am not defined by anxiety or timidity. The Holy Spirit inside me is a fountain of bold love, wisdom, and inner power.', 'valentia', 'mujeres'),
