('b5b0ad83-6868-4347-b3a2-922c44614498', 203, 'The angel answered, "The Holy Spirit will come on you, and the power of the Most High will overshadow you."', 'Luke 1:35', 'The Holy Spirit overshadows my life with His power and peace. What seems impossible in the natural will come to pass by His divine intervention.', 'holy_spirit', 'mujeres'),
