('0f066c4a-e4b5-4b99-bf75-c42bcab64bec', 213, 'And if the Spirit of him who raised Jesus from the dead is living in you, he who raised Christ from the dead will also give life to your mortal bodies because of his Spirit who lives in you.', 'Romans 8:11', 'Resurrection life pulses through my mind, body, and spirit. The same Spirit who raised Jesus from the grave revitalizes every cell of my body and every dream in my heart.', 'holy_spirit', 'mujeres'),
