('01933ab4-4494-4fd0-a369-42b48e7b4967', 286, 'Do not be anxious about anything, but in every situation, by prayer and petition, with thanksgiving, present your requests to God. And the peace of God will guard your hearts and minds.', 'Philippians 4:6-7', 'Today my heart rests in this truth: I release every worry into my Father\'s tender care. His supernatural serenity envelops my thoughts and guards my heart.', 'paz', 'mujeres'),
('bd6d4cef-71ce-446f-a054-3a051f12be6b', 287, 'He heals the brokenhearted and binds up their wounds.', 'Psalm 147:3', 'Today my heart rests in this truth: Jesus gently heals every tender place of my history. He turns deep heartache into a wellspring of empathy, wisdom, and beauty.', 'sanidad', 'mujeres'),
('9afc3257-716c-4ca2-b986-c97a155dd2f0', 288, 'And if the Spirit of him who raised Jesus from the dead is living in you, he who raised Christ from the dead will also give life to your mortal bodies because of his Spirit who lives in you.', 'Romans 8:11', 'Resurrection life pulses through my mind, body, and spirit. The same Spirit who raised Jesus from the grave revitalizes every cell of my body and every dream in my heart.', 'holy_spirit', 'mujeres'),
('b6f7b035-e94a-489a-b78f-2bb81212f228', 289, 'Do not fear, for I have redeemed you; I have summoned you by name; you are mine.', 'Isaiah 43:1', 'Today my heart rests in this truth: I am known, cherished, and called by name by the Creator of the universe. I belong to Him, and I walk without fear.', 'identidad', 'mujeres'),
('712f5fc0-0aa8-4129-b8b7-b37eb7fb57bd', 290, 'Come to me, all you who are weary and burdened, and I will give you rest.', 'Matthew 11:28', 'Today my heart rests in this truth: I lay down the exhausting burden of trying to control everything. In Jesus\' presence, my soul finds true, refreshing rest.', 'paz', 'mujeres'),
('5f7b938a-df22-446e-9a31-8c9676b5f5e7', 291, 'The Lord is my shepherd, I lack nothing. He makes me lie down in green pastures, he leads me beside quiet waters.', 'Psalm 23:1-2', 'Today my heart rests in this truth: The Good Shepherd attends to every detail of my life. He provides all I need and leads my soul into pastures of peace.', 'provision', 'mujeres'),
('87575ed9-a8e7-4562-8d4f-3e1a880764df', 292, 'Those who hope in the Lord will renew their strength. They will soar on wings like eagles; they will run and not grow weary, they will walk and not be faint.', 'Isaiah 40:31', 'Today my heart rests in this truth: As I wait quietly before God, my inner strength is renewed. I rise above fatigue and soar in supernatural grace.', 'fortaleza', 'mujeres'),
('98ae5267-7035-4660-9b54-e0356b603bef', 293, 'The Spirit of the Sovereign Lord is on me, because the Lord has anointed me to proclaim good news to the poor. He has sent me to bind up the brokenhearted.', 'Isaiah 61:1', 'Anointed by the Spirit of the Sovereign Lord, I am a vessel of comfort and healing. My words carry peace to the brokenhearted and light to the weary.', 'holy_spirit', 'mujeres'),
('8303eeac-5f28-4ce0-8df8-70d32f1960d4', 294, 'Heal me, Lord, and I will be healed; save me and I will be saved, for you are the one I praise.', 'Jeremiah 17:14', 'Today my heart rests in this truth: Divine healing cascades over my body and emotions. The Lord is my healer, and wholeness is my daily inheritance.', 'sanidad', 'mujeres'),
('3b0fa708-a54a-422c-88eb-af4bbee4b337', 295, 'Rejoice always, pray continually, give thanks in all circumstances; for this is God’s will for you in Christ Jesus.', '1 Thessalonians 5:16-18', 'Today my heart rests in this truth: I choose joy as my lifestyle. In every circumstance, thanksgiving sweetens my spirit and opens the windows of heaven.', 'gratitud', 'mujeres'),
('1b28733f-f22d-47c9-827c-5cfc27298ade', 296, 'For I am convinced that neither death nor life... nor anything else in all creation, will be able to separate us from the love of God that is in Christ Jesus our Lord.', 'Romans 8:38-39', 'Today my heart rests in this truth: I am anchored in the unbreakable grip of God\'s love. Nothing in all creation can ever separate me from His embrace.', 'amorpropio', 'mujeres'),
('a4faf8b2-bc8b-4df5-bed3-6cf65c1bd459', 297, 'For I know the plans I have for you, declares the Lord, plans to prosper you and not to harm you, plans to give you hope and a future.', 'Jeremiah 29:11', 'Today my heart rests in this truth: My future is bright with God\'s intentional favor. He is preparing a beautiful path of hope, fruitfulness, and purpose for me.', 'proposito', 'mujeres'),
('72b893c7-c058-47b1-8858-49fda090c794', 298, 'Then the church... was strengthened. Living in the fear of the Lord and encouraged by the Holy Spirit, it increased in numbers.', 'Acts 9:31', 'My home and family are built up in the fear of the Lord and daily comforted by the Holy Spirit. We walk in divine unity, peace, and spiritual growth.', 'holy_spirit', 'mujeres'),
('355a5339-586f-46f9-acfe-7de5b4d8dfd2', 299, 'For the Spirit God gave us does not make us timid, but gives us power, love and self-discipline.', '2 Timothy 1:7', 'Today my heart rests in this truth: I am not defined by anxiety or timidity. The Holy Spirit inside me is a fountain of bold love, wisdom, and inner power.', 'valentia', 'mujeres'),
('4bd5d004-3d3e-45cd-a2e7-dd19a456abea', 300, 'To bestow on them a crown of beauty instead of ashes, the oil of joy instead of mourning, and a garment of praise instead of a spirit of despair.', 'Isaiah 61:3', 'Today my heart rests in this truth: The Lord crowns me with royal beauty for every ash of the past. Mourning is finished; joy and praise are my new garments.', 'restauracion', 'mujeres'),
('22126768-331a-4790-9096-c905d474d156', 301, 'She is clothed with strength and dignity; she can laugh at the days to come.', 'Proverbs 31:25', 'With deep joy and assurance, I declare: I am clothed in celestial dignity and unwavering grace. Tomorrow holds no terror for me; I smile at the future with divine joy.', 'identidad', 'mujeres'),
('ab5437a6-1839-454b-9b57-2965228320c2', 302, 'God is within her, she will not fall; God will help her at break of day.', 'Psalm 46:5', 'With deep joy and assurance, I declare: The Living God dwells inside me; I will never collapse under pressure. His dawn brings fresh mercy, breakthrough, and steady peace.', 'fortaleza', 'mujeres'),
('55ea0fd8-3599-4c80-a7e9-636aa61dfde4', 303, 'But the Advocate, the Holy Spirit, whom the Father will send in my name, will teach you all things and will remind you of everything I have said to you.', 'John 14:26', 'The Holy Spirit is my personal Advocate and Comforter. He teaches me divine truth, whispers peace to my soul, and constantly reminds me of Jesus’ tender promises.', 'holy_spirit', 'mujeres'),
('276c1440-049d-4c31-8f53-e0a33b24bd23', 304, 'Rather, it should be that of your inner self, the unfading beauty of a gentle and quiet spirit, which is of great worth in God’s sight.', '1 Peter 3:4', 'With deep joy and assurance, I declare: My true beauty is eternal, rooted in the gentle calm of God\'s presence. I am of priceless value to my Father in heaven.', 'amorpropio', 'mujeres'),
('a1bdc4c9-7824-4dc0-91f0-2eab7a061486', 305, 'For you created my inmost being; you knit me together in my mother’s womb. I praise you because I am fearfully and wonderfully made.', 'Psalm 139:13-14', 'With deep joy and assurance, I declare: I am God\'s intentional design, woven with royal precision. I silence comparison; I celebrate who God shaped me to be.', 'identidad', 'mujeres'),
('17ede226-da70-4b68-9b15-e77612ac3492', 306, 'And who knows but that you have come to your royal position for such a time as this?', 'Esther 4:14', 'With deep joy and assurance, I declare: I am planted in this generation on assignment. God has positioned my life for such a time as this, and I step up with holy boldness.', 'proposito', 'mujeres'),
('ceea1b62-45f4-4660-88e5-6646cf5adb92', 307, 'You are altogether beautiful, my darling; there is no flaw in you.', 'Song of Songs 4:7', 'With deep joy and assurance, I declare: In the eyes of my Savior, I am cleansed, cherished, and complete. Insecurity and shame have no voice in my identity.', 'amorpropio', 'mujeres'),
('6a8050c9-1561-445b-903c-1fccf0f35f04', 308, 'The Spirit you received brought about your adoption to sonship. And by him we cry, "Abba, Father." The Spirit himself testifies with our spirit that we are God’s children.', 'Romans 8:15-16', 'I am a deeply cherished daughter of the King. The Holy Spirit constantly affirms within my spirit that I am loved, accepted, and forever secure in my Father’s arms.', 'holy_spirit', 'mujeres'),
('3a17bb68-cbfc-4316-9003-14c9e3166ea5', 309, 'The Lord your God is with you, the Mighty Warrior who saves. He will take great delight in you; he will rejoice over you with singing.', 'Zephaniah 3:17', 'With deep joy and assurance, I declare: The Lord takes personal delight in me. He quietens my anxieties with His tender affection and sings songs of deliverance over my soul.', 'amorpropio', 'mujeres'),
('243a1801-12f0-4086-95a2-72e50ca2bc3f', 310, 'The Lord appeared to us in the past, saying: \'I have loved you with an everlasting love; I have drawn you with unfailing kindness.\'', 'Jeremiah 31:3', 'With deep joy and assurance, I declare: God\'s love for me will never run dry. His unfailing kindness leads me out of disappointment into restorative abundance.', 'restauracion', 'mujeres'),
('e491b5bb-8480-4200-9b5c-867cd54bc35c', 311, 'Do not be anxious about anything, but in every situation, by prayer and petition, with thanksgiving, present your requests to God. And the peace of God will guard your hearts and minds.', 'Philippians 4:6-7', 'With deep joy and assurance, I declare: I release every worry into my Father\'s tender care. His supernatural serenity envelops my thoughts and guards my heart.', 'paz', 'mujeres'),
('81f9dc4c-ea51-4bca-82a0-03f27c507c7a', 312, 'He heals the brokenhearted and binds up their wounds.', 'Psalm 147:3', 'With deep joy and assurance, I declare: Jesus gently heals every tender place of my history. He turns deep heartache into a wellspring of empathy, wisdom, and beauty.', 'sanidad', 'mujeres'),
('b81e22e6-e94d-488c-9ea0-294e57cee878', 313, 'But the fruit of the Spirit is love, joy, peace, forbearance, kindness, goodness, faithfulness, gentleness and self-control.', 'Galatians 5:22-23', 'The fragrant fruit of the Spirit adorns my life today. I overflow with Christlike kindness, gentle strength, unshakeable peace, and patient grace in my home and workplace.', 'holy_spirit', 'mujeres'),
('0220235d-87f1-40cc-abc7-71f3d8500014', 314, 'Do not fear, for I have redeemed you; I have summoned you by name; you are mine.', 'Isaiah 43:1', 'With deep joy and assurance, I declare: I am known, cherished, and called by name by the Creator of the universe. I belong to Him, and I walk without fear.', 'identidad', 'mujeres'),
('0abe3a70-09bd-4965-b6c5-264821fa89cf', 315, 'Come to me, all you who are weary and burdened, and I will give you rest.', 'Matthew 11:28', 'With deep joy and assurance, I declare: I lay down the exhausting burden of trying to control everything. In Jesus\' presence, my soul finds true, refreshing rest.', 'paz', 'mujeres'),
('1784ad5d-f29f-4e55-9098-2f99d7854d76', 316, 'The Lord is my shepherd, I lack nothing. He makes me lie down in green pastures, he leads me beside quiet waters.', 'Psalm 23:1-2', 'With deep joy and assurance, I declare: The Good Shepherd attends to every detail of my life. He provides all I need and leads my soul into pastures of peace.', 'provision', 'mujeres'),
('b1fd4f84-5aac-49c0-971b-331c55c91fcf', 317, 'Those who hope in the Lord will renew their strength. They will soar on wings like eagles; they will run and not grow weary, they will walk and not be faint.', 'Isaiah 40:31', 'With deep joy and assurance, I declare: As I wait quietly before God, my inner strength is renewed. I rise above fatigue and soar in supernatural grace.', 'fortaleza', 'mujeres'),
('66800169-5625-452a-b54a-4d3f1227aea7', 318, 'And we all, who with unveiled faces contemplate the Lord’s glory, are being transformed into his image with ever-increasing glory, which comes from the Lord, who is the Spirit.', '2 Corinthians 3:18', 'As I gaze upon Jesus, the Holy Spirit transforms me from glory to glory. Past wounds, insecurity, and shame are swallowed up in His radiant beauty.', 'holy_spirit', 'mujeres'),
('b716a165-6891-4a97-8033-f2854f3a728b', 319, 'Heal me, Lord, and I will be healed; save me and I will be saved, for you are the one I praise.', 'Jeremiah 17:14', 'With deep joy and assurance, I declare: Divine healing cascades over my body and emotions. The Lord is my healer, and wholeness is my daily inheritance.', 'sanidad', 'mujeres'),
('323ed9c8-c284-41ac-bb41-6e1bbadadaca', 320, 'Rejoice always, pray continually, give thanks in all circumstances; for this is God’s will for you in Christ Jesus.', '1 Thessalonians 5:16-18', 'With deep joy and assurance, I declare: I choose joy as my lifestyle. In every circumstance, thanksgiving sweetens my spirit and opens the windows of heaven.', 'gratitud', 'mujeres'),
('85d9328a-1f7c-4a5e-97df-baf78fc9796b', 321, 'For I am convinced that neither death nor life... nor anything else in all creation, will be able to separate us from the love of God that is in Christ Jesus our Lord.', 'Romans 8:38-39', 'With deep joy and assurance, I declare: I am anchored in the unbreakable grip of God\'s love. Nothing in all creation can ever separate me from His embrace.', 'amorpropio', 'mujeres'),
('337dc2df-5cf3-485f-9327-2b318d2d0180', 322, 'For I know the plans I have for you, declares the Lord, plans to prosper you and not to harm you, plans to give you hope and a future.', 'Jeremiah 29:11', 'With deep joy and assurance, I declare: My future is bright with God\'s intentional favor. He is preparing a beautiful path of hope, fruitfulness, and purpose for me.', 'proposito', 'mujeres'),
('2d2f17f8-7780-4d37-9dc2-f5966dea75f2', 323, 'He saved us, not because of righteous things we had done, but because of his mercy. He saved us through the washing of rebirth and renewal by the Holy Spirit.', 'Titus 3:5', 'I am washed clean and daily renewed by the precious Holy Spirit. His grace makes all things fresh, pure, and full of divine hope in my life.', 'holy_spirit', 'mujeres'),
('a6d3bc55-3183-4271-bbd2-9ab1cb3073ed', 324, 'For the Spirit God gave us does not make us timid, but gives us power, love and self-discipline.', '2 Timothy 1:7', 'With deep joy and assurance, I declare: I am not defined by anxiety or timidity. The Holy Spirit inside me is a fountain of bold love, wisdom, and inner power.', 'valentia', 'mujeres'),
('33630043-39e1-4a5f-8180-59246d873313', 325, 'To bestow on them a crown of beauty instead of ashes, the oil of joy instead of mourning, and a garment of praise instead of a spirit of despair.', 'Isaiah 61:3', 'With deep joy and assurance, I declare: The Lord crowns me with royal beauty for every ash of the past. Mourning is finished; joy and praise are my new garments.', 'restauracion', 'mujeres'),
('a6d61359-6dce-47dc-a8ad-f3794eb3a218', 326, 'She is clothed with strength and dignity; she can laugh at the days to come.', 'Proverbs 31:25', 'Clothed in God\'s grace and favor: I am clothed in celestial dignity and unwavering grace. Tomorrow holds no terror for me; I smile at the future with divine joy.', 'identidad', 'mujeres'),
('38efb487-caf0-47a6-9416-6ca9ffb2ec70', 327, 'God is within her, she will not fall; God will help her at break of day.', 'Psalm 46:5', 'Clothed in God\'s grace and favor: The Living God dwells inside me; I will never collapse under pressure. His dawn brings fresh mercy, breakthrough, and steady peace.', 'fortaleza', 'mujeres'),
('10465af3-6597-4677-bb47-8a281585ffa1', 328, 'And hope does not put us to shame, because God’s love has been poured out into our hearts through the Holy Spirit, who has been given to us.', 'Romans 5:5', 'The lavish, unconditional love of God is poured out lavishly into my heart by the Holy Spirit. Fear of rejection has no power over my thoughts.', 'holy_spirit', 'mujeres'),
('3431086d-467a-427c-85af-d99ecc80fb26', 329, 'Rather, it should be that of your inner self, the unfading beauty of a gentle and quiet spirit, which is of great worth in God’s sight.', '1 Peter 3:4', 'Clothed in God\'s grace and favor: My true beauty is eternal, rooted in the gentle calm of God\'s presence. I am of priceless value to my Father in heaven.', 'amorpropio', 'mujeres'),
('5944ceec-3a44-47b2-ad74-0535dc5be204', 330, 'For you created my inmost being; you knit me together in my mother’s womb. I praise you because I am fearfully and wonderfully made.', 'Psalm 139:13-14', 'Clothed in God\'s grace and favor: I am God\'s intentional design, woven with royal precision. I silence comparison; I celebrate who God shaped me to be.', 'identidad', 'mujeres'),
