('f037aba5-9be8-43f9-89e6-8cc026bb46bc', 332, 'You are altogether beautiful, my darling; there is no flaw in you.', 'Song of Songs 4:7', 'Clothed in God\'s grace and favor: In the eyes of my Savior, I am cleansed, cherished, and complete. Insecurity and shame have no voice in my identity.', 'amorpropio', 'mujeres'),
('dfba3f3d-4629-46e1-9641-e1a8e6c0cc7d', 333, 'Teach me to do your will, for you are my God; may your good Spirit lead me on level ground.', 'Psalm 143:10', 'The gentle Holy Spirit leads my steps onto level ground. When the terrain seems steep or uncertain, His hand guides me safely and securely.', 'holy_spirit', 'mujeres'),
('50159d29-5e3c-4fb4-ad45-50a68d13bb9b', 334, 'The Lord your God is with you, the Mighty Warrior who saves. He will take great delight in you; he will rejoice over you with singing.', 'Zephaniah 3:17', 'Clothed in God\'s grace and favor: The Lord takes personal delight in me. He quietens my anxieties with His tender affection and sings songs of deliverance over my soul.', 'amorpropio', 'mujeres'),
('019654cf-56c9-4a72-b314-1b62abd8242f', 335, 'The Lord appeared to us in the past, saying: \'I have loved you with an everlasting love; I have drawn you with unfailing kindness.\'', 'Jeremiah 31:3', 'Clothed in God\'s grace and favor: God\'s love for me will never run dry. His unfailing kindness leads me out of disappointment into restorative abundance.', 'restauracion', 'mujeres');
