('38d1f405-f837-4adc-854f-055eedbd863c', 338, 'Now to each one the manifestation of the Spirit is given for the common good.', '1 Corinthians 12:7', 'The Holy Spirit has uniquely gifted me with heavenly grace and wisdom. I steward my gifts to build up others, bring life, and glorify my Savior.', 'holy_spirit', 'mujeres'),
('1645049e-1b62-48aa-8e9a-32dd0fd5a672', 339, 'Do not fear, for I have redeemed you; I have summoned you by name; you are mine.', 'Isaiah 43:1', 'Clothed in God\'s grace and favor: I am known, cherished, and called by name by the Creator of the universe. I belong to Him, and I walk without fear.', 'identidad', 'mujeres'),
