('c53f9d49-5649-4f25-83da-5fc94dc3415f', 348, 'And I will ask the Father, and he will give you another advocate to help you and be with you forever—the Spirit of truth.', 'John 14:16-17', 'I will never walk alone. The Holy Spirit dwells inside me as an eternal Companion, Wise Counselor, and Faithful Guardian through every season.', 'holy_spirit', 'mujeres'),
