('e06ffb59-3de3-4a8b-b3e5-c24dfd81c7c9', 353, 'The angel answered, "The Holy Spirit will come on you, and the power of the Most High will overshadow you."', 'Luke 1:35', 'The Holy Spirit overshadows my life with His power and peace. What seems impossible in the natural will come to pass by His divine intervention.', 'holy_spirit', 'mujeres'),
